# The Fogworks' fog cellars (CIPlay the_fogworks_caves, 11-13 w11; in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe:
# the mouth strip (3 m) from -34 -26 west into the spoil knoll; the level passage to the long cellar (-50..-57 -26), a
# side passage from -45 -26 to the small cellar at -51 -37. A boar (Warthog) dens in the long cellar.
island The Fogworks keep
offset -0.2923 13.3454
hour 11
weather Calm
picture fw_cave_out -26 8 -20 -38 4 -26
expect animals Warthog 1
expect animalsinside Warthog 1
walk -33 -26 to -36 -26 to -40 -26 below=6
picture fw_boar -40 4.6 -26 -53 3.6 -26 aim=Warthog light=20
kill Warthog
expect animals Warthog 0
walk -40 -26 to -45 -26 to -50 -26 to -55.5 -26 below=6
picture fw_cave_in -46 4.6 -26 -56 3.4 -26 light=20
walk -55.5 -26 to -50 -26 to -45.5 -27 to -46.5 -32 to -49 -35.5 below=6
walk -49 -35.5 to -46.5 -32 to -45.5 -27 to -40 -26 to -33 -26 below=6
